    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n20202" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Hămilcar</span></b>  (<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Amilcar</span></b> ), ăris, m.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>A general</i>, <i>son of Gisgo</i>,
				<i>slain in besieging Syracuse</i>, <i><span class="en">Cic. Div.
				1, 24, 50</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Val. Max. 1, 7</span></i>, ext.
			8.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b> Hamilcar
			Barca, <i>the father of Hannibal</i>, <i><span class="en">Cic. Off.
				3, 26, 99</span></i>; Nep. Ham.; <i><span class="en">Liv. 21, 2
				sq.</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Val. Max. 6, 6, 2</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Sil. 1, 72
				al.</span></i></div>
